flowchart TB
accTitle: Feature validation and production release have separate paths
accDescr: Feature changes build and test in an isolated account, and only reviewed source merges trigger the main-branch production artifact path.
F[GitHub feature branch]:::inputData --> DEV[Feature pipeline, build and tests]
DEV --> TEST[Test-account artifact]:::storage
TEST --> REVIEW{Tests pass and review approved?}:::decision
REVIEW -->|yes| MAIN[Merge into main]:::inputData
REVIEW -->|no| EDIT[Continue feature work]:::warning
EDIT --> F
MAIN --> PROD[Production pipeline]
PROD --> RELEASE[Separate production artifact]:::output
